# Email from social (Spencer Step 3 — Mail + CRM)

**Who this is for:** Any agent writing **FluentCRM / ML Mail** emails, newsletters, or event follow-ups that should **continue** a social post — not restart from scratch.

**Source:** Spencer Office Hours **#00b** (2026-08-21, `ee7Q8-Wptxc`) — “content must not die on the feed.”  
**Companion rule (social / reel stills):** `.cursor/rules/reel-social-from-stills.mdc`

---

## The rule in one sentence

When Sacred Ground ships a **strong social post** (reel, reel still, morning flyer, spotlight), **email should follow within ~1–2 days** using the **same visual family** and a **clear book/visit CTA** — so the post doesn’t die on the feed.

