## Examples (pattern, not templates)

| Social post | Email should… |
|-------------|----------------|
| **S1E3-B** reel — “We found the first crystal…” | Same episode still or video thumb; invite guesses + Observatory/visit; link events or shop — **don’t** spoil Lemuria unless Founder approves |
| **Mabon workshop** still | Same simplified flyer art; Kate’s workshop + booking link; warm fall equinox tone |
| **Morning flyer** (today/tomorrow) | Same flyer image; expand schedule in body with clickable practitioner links |
| **Afternoon spotlight** | Same practitioner/event image; “still time to book” + Fluent Booking URL |

---

## Analytics loop (Spencer)

After send, track **social → site → conversion** as one campaign:

- What performed on social informs the **next** email angle — not two separate guess-machines.
- Fernando / analytics can answer “what post won?” — double down in email and the next social slot.

---

## Do not

- Email with a **random** hero while social showed something else (continuity break).
- **Only** post to social and walk away on **series episodes** or **paid workshops**.
- Copy **prices onto graphics** if the source flyer was price-free; body may mention booking, not dollar amounts on images.
- Use email to **republish S1E1** or violate reel never-republish locks.

